# {{agentName}} — A2A agent

Generated by genproj (`pydantic-agent`). This is a [Pydantic AI](https://ai.pydantic.dev/)
agent served over the [A2A protocol](https://a2a-protocol.org/) by the official
[A2A Python SDK](https://github.com/a2aproject/a2a-python) (`a2a-sdk`).

